<title>GREECE: BANK OF CYPRUS LAUNCHES REP OFFICE IN TORONTO.</title>
<headline>BANK OF CYPRUS LAUNCHES REP OFFICE IN TORONTO.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Cyprus launched a representative office in Toronto, Canada, its first office in north America, it said on Thursday.</p>
<p>&quot;The group's plolicy is to widen activities in communities with residents of Greek descent. The office will be managed by Kyriakos Elles, an experienced banker,&quot; it said. --George Georgiopoulos, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
